NOTE ON DATA AND OUTPUT

The MIT licence above covers the CODE only. It does not license:

  * the underlying hazard data, which belongs to the originating agencies and
    is redistributed here with attribution under their open-data terms:
      - PVMBG/Badan Geologi, Kementerian ESDM (MAGMA Indonesia)
      - Bureau of Meteorology, Australia (Darwin VAAC) — (c) Commonwealth of
        Australia, used with attribution
      - JMA/NOAA (Himawari-9 products via NOAA Open Data on AWS)
      - NASA EOSDIS GIBS/FIRMS (imagery and thermal anomalies)
      - Natural Earth (public-domain map vectors)
  * the derived ash-transport model output, which is an UNCONFIRMED estimate.
    Any redistribution of it must keep the disclosure text shipped in
    site/app.js (I18N.disclosure) and the attribution to this project.

See CONTRIBUTING.md and the "Data credits & licensing" section of README.md.

